update configuration
set value = value || '{"labelAutoAssignmentForPlace": "For the place {name} ({country}), evaluate each label below. Answer true only if the place is distinctly notable for this label - not just because it vaguely applies. If you do not know the place, answer false for all. If unsure which place is meant, it is located in the region {region}. Return a JSON array in the same order as the input. Each element must have: \"label\": the label name, \"reason\": one sentence, \"answer\": a boolean true or false. Labels: {labels}", "labelAutoAssignmentForLabel": "For the label {label}, evaluate each place below. Answer true only if the place is distinctly notable for this label - not just because it vaguely applies. If you do not know the place, answer false. Return a JSON array in the same order as the input. Each element must have: \"place\": the place name, \"reason\": one sentence, \"answer\": a boolean true or false. Places: {places}"}'::jsonb
where key = 'generativeContentPrompt';
